service github: ```md
---
transport: http
target: https://mcp.github.com/mcp
description: GitHub MCP server
---

Use this service when the agent needs to inspect repositories and pull requests.
```

prompt summarize(style, audience?): ```md
Summarize the request in a {{style}} style.
Audience: {{audience}}

{{input}}
```

psyche reviewer: ```md
Prefer concrete findings, direct language, and minimal fluff.
```

struct ReviewSummary: ```json
{
  "title": "string",
  "summary": "string"
}
```

thunk summarize(user) => ReviewSummary:
    model = gpt-5

    Summarize the request and keep the output compact.
